{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["יוצאי יריכו — those who came to Egypt." "All the persons, sixty-six — because Yaakov, who is included in the reckoning of the thirty-three of Leah, is not among יוצאי יריכו, for those who were יוצאי יריכו were only sixty-nine. And likewise Moshe said: ״בשבעים נפש ירדו אבותיך מצרימה״ — that Yaakov and his sons were seventy."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:22.325185315Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}